<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <meta name="description" content="EcoNews - Notícias sobre sustentabilidade, economia circular e meio ambiente">
    <title>EcoNews | Sustentabilidade em Foco</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body class="light-mode">
    <!-- Header com Navegação -->
    <header class="header">
        <nav class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo">
                <a href="#">
                    <span class="logo-icon"><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i></span>
                    <span class="logo-text">Eco<span>News</span></span>
                </a>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Menu Desktop -->
            <ul class="nav-menu desktop-menu">
                <li><a href="#" class="nav-link active">Início</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="nav-link">Sustentabilidade</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="nav-link">Economia</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="nav-link">Tecnologia</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="nav-link">Opinião</a></li>
            </ul>
            
            <div class="nav-actions">
                <!-- Dark Mode Toggle -->
                <button id="darkModeToggle" class="dark-mode-btn" aria-label="Alternar tema">
                    <i class="fas fa-moon"></i>
                    <i class="fas fa-sun"></i>
                </button>
                
                <!-- Menu Hambúrguer (Mobile) -->
                <button id="hamburgerBtn" class="hamburger" aria-label="Menu">
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                    <span></span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </nav>
        
        <!-- Menu Mobile Overlay -->
        <div id="mobileMenu" class="mobile-menu">
            <div class="mobile-menu-header">
                <span class="mobile-logo">EcoNews</span>
                <button id="closeMenuBtn" class="close-menu" aria-label="Fechar menu">
                    <i class="fas fa-times"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            <ul class="mobile-nav-list">
                <li><a href="#" class="mobile-nav-link active">Início</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="mobile-nav-link">Sustentabilidade</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="mobile-nav-link">Economia Circular</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="mobile-nav-link">Tecnologia Verde</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="mobile-nav-link">Fast Fashion</a></li>
                <li><a href="#" class="mobile-nav-link">Opinião</a></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mobile-menu-footer">
                <p>Siga-nos</p>
                <div class="social-icons">
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="hero-tag">Destaque da Semana</span>
                <h1>O futuro da sustentabilidade começa agora</h1>
                <p>Exploramos os caminhos para um planeta mais equilibrado através da economia circular, inovação verde e consumo consciente.</p>
                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#" class="btn-primary">Explorar <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
                    <a href="#" class="btn-outline">Assinar Newsletter</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-stats">
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-number">+2.5M</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Leitores mensais</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-number">150+</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Artigos publicados</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-number">30+</span>
                    <span class="stat-label">Especialistas</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Featured Section -->
        <section class="featured">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Editorias em Destaque</h2>
                <p>Conteúdo atualizado sobre as principais pautas ambientais</p>
            </div>
            <div class="featured-grid">
                <div class="featured-card">
                    <div class="featured-icon"><i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i></div>
                    <h3>Pegada Ecológica</h3>
                    <p>Entenda como medimos o impacto humano no planeta e as soluções para reduzi-lo.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="featured-card">
                    <div class="featured-icon"><i class="fas fa-recycle"></i></div>
                    <h3>Economia Circular</h3>
                    <p>O modelo que elimina desperdícios e mantém materiais em circulação.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="featured-card">
                    <div class="featured-icon"><i class="fas fa-store"></i></div>
                    <h3>Fast Fashion</h3>
                    <p>Os impactos da indústria da moda e alternativas sustentáveis.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- News Feed Section - Renderizado dinamicamente -->
        <section class="news-feed">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Feed de Notícias</h2>
                <p>Últimos artigos e análises sobre sustentabilidade</p>
            </div>
            <div id="newsGrid" class="news-grid">
                <!-- Cards serão inseridos dinamicamente via JavaScript -->
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Highlights Section -->
        <section class="highlights">
            <div class="highlights-container">
                <div class="highlights-text">
                    <span class="highlight-badge">Greenwashing</span>
                    <h2>Como identificar práticas enganosas de marketing verde</h2>
                    <p>Empresas que se dizem sustentáveis sem realmente o serem. Aprenda a reconhecer os sinais do greenwashing e faça escolhas conscientes.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="read-more">Leia mais <i class="fas fa-chevron-right"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="highlights-stats">
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <i class="fas fa-chart-simple"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong>73%</strong>
                            <span>dos consumidores preferem marcas sustentáveis</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-item">
                        <i class="fas fa-building"></i>
                        <div>
                            <strong>40%</strong>
                            <span>das alegações verdes são enganosas</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Newsletter Section -->
        <section class="newsletter">
            <div class="newsletter-content">
                <i class="fas fa-envelope-open-text"></i>
                <h2>Receba conteúdo exclusivo</h2>
                <p>Inscreva-se para receber as principais notícias sobre sustentabilidade diretamente no seu email.</p>
                <form id="newsletterForm" class="newsletter-form">
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Seu melhor e-mail" required>
                    <button type="submit">Inscrever <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i></button>
                </form>
                <small>Sem spam. Cancelar a qualquer momento.</small>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-container">
            <div class="footer-about">
                <div class="footer-logo">
                    <i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
                    <span>EcoNews</span>
                </div>
                <p>Informação de qualidade para um futuro sustentável. Conteúdo produzido com base nos princípios da economia circular e responsabilidade socioambiental.</p>
                <div class="footer-social">
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <h4>Explorar</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Início</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Sobre Nós</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Artigos</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Podcast</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Eventos</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <h4>Conteúdo</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Economia Circular</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Pegada Ecológica</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Logística Reversa</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Bioeconomia</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Sustentabilidade Digital</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-contact">
                <h4>Contato</h4>
                <p><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> contato@econews.com</p>
                <p><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i> (11) 98765-4321</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>&copy; 2024 EcoNews - Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
/* ===== VARIÁVEIS GLOBAIS ===== */
:root {
    /* Light Mode (padrão) */
    --bg-primary: #ffffff;
    --bg-secondary: #f7f9fc;
    --bg-tertiary: #e8f5e9;
    --text-primary: #1a2a3a;
    --text-secondary: #4a5568;
    --text-muted: #718096;
    --border-color: #e2e8f0;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --header-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    --primary-color: #2e7d32;
    --primary-dark: #1b5e20;
    --primary-light: #4caf50;
    --accent-color: #ff9800;
    --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    --shadow-lg: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    --transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

body.dark-mode {
    --bg-primary: #0f1724;
    --bg-secondary: #1a2332;
    --bg-tertiary: #1e2a3a;
    --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
    --text-secondary: #cbd5e1;
    --text-muted: #94a3b8;
    --border-color: #2d3a4a;
    --card-bg: #1e293b;
    --header-bg: rgba(15, 23, 36, 0.95);
    --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    --shadow-lg: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
}

/* ===== TIPOGRAFIA ===== */
h1, h2, h3, h4, .logo-text, .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
    h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
    }
}

/* ===== HEADER ===== */
.header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 1000;
    background-color: var(--header-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.nav-container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.logo a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
}

.logo-icon {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
}

.logo-text {
    color: var(--text-primary);
}

.logo-text span {
    color: var(--primary-color);
}

/* Menu Desktop */
.desktop-menu {
    display: none;
}

@media (min-width: 992px) {
    .desktop-menu {
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
        list-style: none;
    }
    
    .nav-link {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: var(--transition);
    }
    
    .nav-link:hover,
    .nav-link.active {
        color: var(--primary-color);
    }
}

.nav-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
}

/* Dark Mode Button */
.dark-mode-btn {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: var(--transition);
    color: var(--text-primary);
}

.dark-mode-btn .fa-sun {
    display: none;
}

body.dark-mode .dark-mode-btn .fa-moon {
    display: none;
}

body.dark-mode .dark-mode-btn .fa-sun {
    display: inline-block;
}

/* Hamburger Menu */
.hamburger {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.5rem;
}

@media (min-width: 992px) {
    .hamburger {
        display: none;
    }
}

.hamburger span {
    width: 24px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--text-primary);
    transition: var(--transition);
}

/* Mobile Menu */
.mobile-menu {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    right: -100%;
    width: 80%;
    max-width: 320px;
    height: 100vh;
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    z-index: 2000;
    transition: right 0.3s ease;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow-y: auto;
}

.mobile-menu.active {
    right: 0;
}

.mobile-menu-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.mobile-logo {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary-color);
}

.close-menu {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text-primary);
}

.mobile-nav-list {
    list-style: none;
    flex: 1;
}

.mobile-nav-link {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.875rem 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    transition: var(--transition);
}

.mobile-nav-link:hover,
.mobile-nav-link.active {
    color: var(--primary-color);
}

.mobile-menu-footer {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
}

.social-icons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
}

.social-icons a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    transition: var(--transition);
}

.social-icons a:hover {
    color: var(--primary-color);
}

/* ===== HERO SECTION ===== */
.hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-secondary) 0%, var(--bg-primary) 100%);
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }
}

.hero-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

.hero-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: var(--primary-light);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.25rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
    }
}

.hero p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn-primary, .btn-outline {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 40px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: var(--transition);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--primary-dark);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.btn-outline {
    border: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
    color: var(--primary-color);
}

.btn-outline:hover {
    background-color: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
}

.hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.stat {
    text-align: center;
}

.stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary-color);
}

.stat-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* ===== FEATURED SECTION ===== */
.featured {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

.section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.section-header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
}

.featured-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
}

@media (min-width: 640px) {
    .featured-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .featured-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
}

.featured-card {
    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: var(--transition);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.featured-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

.featured-icon {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background-color: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.featured-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.featured-card p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ===== NEWS FEED ===== */
.news-feed {
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
}

.news-grid {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
}

@media (min-width: 640px) {
    .news-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
}

@media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .news-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
}

.news-card {
    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: var(--transition);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.news-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

.news-image {
    height: 200px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    position: relative;
}

.news-category {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    left: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--primary-color);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.news-content {
    padding: 1.5rem;
}

.news-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.news-excerpt {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
}

.news-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
}

.read-more-link {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: var(--transition);
}

.read-more-link:hover {
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

/* ===== HIGHLIGHTS ===== */
.highlights {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-tertiary) 0%, var(--bg-secondary) 100%);
}

.highlights-container {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
    .highlights-container {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        align-items: center;
    }
}

.highlight-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: var(--accent-color);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.highlights-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
    .highlights-text h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
    }
}

.highlights-text p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.read-more {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.highlights-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
